==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Bearkini]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is surprisingly difficult. Still, if you've beaten EoC Chapter 3 and obtained treasures, it shouldn't pose too much of a problem. It is effective to group the Gories by spamming meatshields and deploy [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to clear the stack.

